// A 16x2 character LCD panel (1602A class) on the HD44780U's own parallel bus: RS, R/W, E and
// DB0 to DB7, 4-bit or 8-bit, per Hitachi ADE-207-272. The pins are the module's 16, in the
// order of Vishay LCD-016N002B p. 2. A and K are the backlight's, which the module wires to its
// own LED part; the model only watches them, to know whether the backlight is lit.
