      "source": { "datasheet": { "doc": "Hitachi HD44780U (ADE-207-272)", "at": "p. 51, DC Characteristics, LCD voltage VLCD1 = VCC - V5 at 1/5 bias, 3.0 V minimum. V0 is the module's end of the V1 to V5 ladder (p. 37, Figure 21), so VDD - V0 under 3.0 V leaves the glass without characters. Vishay LCD-016N002B p. 1 recommends VDD to V0 3.8 V typical at 25 C.", "basis": "min" } },
